msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Работа? Что за работа?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bee90fa991131fa83d26da8dd08a39f76842b76b5aa08a0b92d7e1347c2d6379
