#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31e64b4c62fbdac559a7a0211d1d5a4c1da506425dc2266d2556cbc439188ed7
